<!--
  wp81_weather_snow - snow.

  From the Weather set by Good Ware (flaticon.com/authors/good-ware): the pack's own paths,
  unedited and unscaled, emitted white so callers can tint per accent and per light/dark
  theme.

  The only thing not taken from the file is the viewport, which is refitted to a square
  around what the mark actually draws. The pack does not agree with itself about that -
  most of the marks fill their box and the fog sits in the middle of one an eighth larger
  than it needs - so a mark's size on screen would otherwise depend on how much empty room
  its author happened to leave around it. Fitted this way they are one set again, at the
  proportions the set was drawn in.

  Nothing here is optically retouched. If one of these reads small beside the others, that
  is the pack's own drawing and the place to change it is the pack.
-->
